    menu "Agent Skills Configuration"
        config PKG_AGENT_SKILL_DIR
            string "Markdown skill directory"
            default "skills"
            help
                Recursively embed .md files as const C strings at build time.
                Relative paths are resolved from the Agent package directory;
                absolute paths are also supported. Use UTF-8 Markdown files.
                The relative path without .md is the skill name.
                Override for one build with scons agent_skill_dir=<directory>.
